          <choice_text>13 19</choice_text>
          <commentary>오프셋은 19비트가 아니라 11비트이다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="3" is_answer="false" judgment="[X]">
          <choice_text>19 13</choice_text>
          <commentary>오프셋은 13비트가 아니라 11비트이다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="4" is_answer="true" judgment="[O] (정답)">
          <choice_text>21 11</choice_text>
          <commentary>가상 페이지 번호 21비트, 오프셋 11비트이므로 옳다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
      </choice_explanations>
